{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/FinalImage_1.1.1.png?t=1741158411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step back into the shoes of rookie agent Bruce\u2014aka \u2018Agent Cock\u2019\u2014and push your seductive talents to new heights. You\u2019ve already won a few hearts, but now it\u2019s time to really turn up the heat. Season 2 pushes your powers of seduction to the limit, all against the backdrop of an escalating standoff between the Zhine family and Hack\u2019n\u2019Slay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your charm keep you out of the crossfire when these two forces collide again? After all, you\u2019ve got ties to both sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/F_1.1.1.png?t=1741158411\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Zhine family\u2019s never been more desperate for your talents. Keep impressing Hector Zhine\u2014he\u2019s ruthless, but earning his favor could give you the edge you need. Get closer to Lilith, explore Kendra\u2019s newfound desires, and watch Freya\u2019s back. But watch yours, too: danger is coming from all sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Zhine\u2019s world, no betrayal goes unpunished, and he sees more than he lets on. Worse yet, Agent Lawson is quietly reaching out to every person you\u2019ve won over, trying to flip their loyalties. If he spots you, your luck might just run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Lil_1.1.1.png?t=1741158411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if someone sees you getting too cozy with Lilith? Crossing lines with Mia\u2014Zhine\u2019s mistress\u2014only adds fuel to the fire. Even Kendra can\u2019t help catching feelings for you, and Freya\u2019s staying far from Zhine but awfully close to you. <br>Stay sharp! Someone\u2019s got eyes on everything you do! Sure, Zhine owes you for saving his life, but that doesn\u2019t mean he\u2019ll let you waltz off with every woman in his circle. Are you ready to deal with the fallout when your secrets come to light?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tough choices lie ahead, Agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Ep5_NSS_1.26.1.jpg?t=1741158411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Season 2 DLC Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>5,000</strong> Full HD renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>45+</strong> sex scenes, featuring 500+ animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New ambient tracks, music, and erotic sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A massive new heist to plan and pull off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new Morph cooking system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More action, more parties\u2026 and way more fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Season 3, the final chapter, will also be available as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Ep5_Heist_OfficeFV_1.11.1.png?t=1741158411\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552650?t=1741158411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/93c5fc7f2285349134332f1fcefb27d19ef0a828/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741158411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/7e72fae0b77d2cdf82c8022192947f253ed56bf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741158411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/7e72fae0b77d2cdf82c8022192947f253e