lip their loyalties. If he spots you, your luck might just run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Lil_1.1.1.png?t=1741158411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if someone sees you getting too cozy with Lilith? Crossing lines with Mia\u2014Zhine\u2019s mistress\u2014only adds fuel to the fire. Even Kendra can\u2019t help catching feelings for you, and Freya\u2019s staying far from Zhine but awfully close to you. <br>Stay sharp! Someone\u2019s got eyes on everything you do! Sure, Zhine owes you for saving his life, but that doesn\u2019t mean he\u2019ll let you waltz off with every woman in his circle. Are you ready to deal with the fallout when your secrets come to light?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tough choices lie ahead, Agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Ep5_NSS_1.26.1.jpg?t=1741158411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Season 2 DLC Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>5,000</strong> Full HD renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>45+</strong> sex scenes, featuring 500+ animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New ambient tracks, music, and erotic sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A massive new heist to plan and pull off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new Morph cooking system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More action, more parties\u2026 and way more fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Season 3, the final chapter, will also be available as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552650/extras/Ep5_Heist_OfficeFV_1.11.1.png?t=1741158411\" /></p>","developers":["1Thousand"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2724540","n